><![CDATA['Stable job, high income': Man shares tips after his B1/B2 visa got approved in 2 minutes in Chennai consulate]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126469728.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/stable-job-high-income-man-shares-tips-after-his-b1/b2-visa-got-approved-in-2-minutes-at-chennai-consulate/articleshow/126469728.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/stable-job-high-income-man-shares-tips-after-his-b1/b2-visa-got-approved-in-2-minutes-at-chennai-consulate/articleshow/126469728.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-12T00:01:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126469753,imgsize-99512.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Son of ousted Shah says 'ready to return' at first opportunity]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126469769.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/son-of-ousted-shah-says-ready-to-return-at-first-opportunity/articleshow/126469769.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/son-of-ousted-shah-says-ready-to-return-at-first-opportunity/articleshow/126469769.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-12T00:01:05+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126469751,imgsize-492975.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Lebanon: Israel strikes Hezbollah infrastructure; comes days after evacuation warning]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126468777.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Israeli warplanes conducted multiple strikes in southern Lebanon targeting Hezbollah infrastructure after issuing an evacuation warning. These attacks followed Lebanon's announcement of completing the first phase of a plan to disarm Hezbollah, which Israel deemed insufficient under the ceasefire. Israel continues regular strikes despite the November 2024 truce.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/lebanon-israel-strikes-hezbollah-infrastructure-comes-days-after-evacuation-warning/articleshow/126468777.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/lebanon-israel-strikes-hezbollah-infrastructure-comes-days-after-evacuation-warning/articleshow/126468777.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-11T23:19:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126468778,imgsize-1075871.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Bill Gates sends $7.9 billion to Melinda Gates’ nonprofit in one of the biggest charity transfers ever]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126468580.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Bill Gates has gifted $7.9 billion to Melinda Gates' nonprofit, Pivotal Philanthropies Foundation, in a massive charitable transfer. This significant move, part of a post-divorce agreement, instantly elevates her foundation to one of the world's most well-funded private charities. The funds will support initiatives in mental health, reducing political violence, and women's workplace leadership.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/bill-gates-sends-7-9-billion-to-melinda-gates-nonprofit-in-one-of-the-biggest-charity-transfers-ever/articleshow/126468580.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/bill-gates-sends-7-9-billion-to-melinda-gates-nonprofit-in-one-of-the-biggest-charity-transfers-ever/articleshow/126468580.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-11T23:17:09+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126468652,imgsize-40760.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[What is ‘pink cocaine’? Inside the dangerous polydrug spreading in US nightlife]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126467932.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A dangerous new drug, dubbed 'pink cocaine' or 'tuci,' is alarming US health officials. This potent, unpredictable powder, often a mix of ketamine, ecstasy, and other substances, is appearing in nightclubs and drug busts nationwide. Its varied composition significantly raises overdose risks, with no standard antidote available, leaving responders to manage symptoms as the drugs clear.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/what-is-pink-cocaine-inside-the-dangerous-polydrug-spreading-in-us-nightlife/articleshow/126467932.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/what-is-pink-cocaine-inside-the-dangerous-polydrug-spreading-in-us-nightlife/articleshow/126467932.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-11T22:53:32+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126468069,imgsize-79351.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Did Bill Ackman donate for ICE officer Jonathan Ross who shot Minneapolis woman Renee Good dead?]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126468165.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/did-bill-ackman-donate-for-ice-officer-jonathan-ross-who-shot-minneapolis-woman-renee-good-dead/articleshow/126468165.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/did-bill-ackman-donate-for-ice-officer-jonathan-ross-who-shot-minneapolis-woman-renee-good-dead/articleshow/126468165.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-11T22:44:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126468184,imgsize-932126.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Greenland row: EU floats idea of 100,000-strong joint force; aims to cut reliance on US troops]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126467810.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[EU defence commissioner Andrius Kubilius proposed a 100,000-strong joint European military force to potentially replace US troops, citing concerns over Washington's long-term commitment. He also advocated for a European Security Council to expedite defence decisions, with Ukraine's war as a top priority.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/powerful-standing-european-military-eu-floats-idea-of-100000-strong-joint-force-aims-to-cut-reliance-on-us-troops-amid-greenland-row/articleshow/126467810.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/powerful-standing-european-military-eu-floats-idea-of-100000-strong-joint-force-aims-to-cut-reliance-on-us-troops-amid-greenland-row/articleshow/126467810.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-11T22:21:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126467935,imgsize-199967.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Iran protest: At least 500 dead in crackdown; Tehran warns US, Israel of consequences]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126467999.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Iran's crackdown on nationwide protests has reportedly killed over 538, with thousands detained amid an internet blackout. Tehran has warned the US and Israel of "legitimate targets" if force is used to protect demonstrators. Protests persist despite heavy security, fueled by economic collapse and calls challenging the theocratic system.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/iran-protest-at-least-538-dead-in-crackdown-tehran-warns-us-israel-of-consequences/articleshow/126467999.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/iran-protest-at-least-538-dead-in-crackdown-tehran-warns-us-israel-of-consequences/articleshow/126467999.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-11T22:33:34+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126467999,imgsize-46236.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[How ICE ratings changed after Minnesota shooting — in numbers]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126467364.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/how-ice-ratings-changed-after-minnesota-shooting-in-numbers/articleshow/126467364.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/how-ice-ratings-changed-after-minnesota-shooting-in-numbers/articleshow/126467364.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-11T22:08:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126467364,imgsize-1663175.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Storms claim another life in UK]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126467606.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[UK police said a falling tree killed a man in England after record winds brought by Storm Goretti, and nearly 40,000 homes in France were still without power Saturday. Storm Goretti also ploughed through other parts of northern Europe, with at its peak some 380,000 homes in France without power.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/storms-claim-another-life-in-uk/articleshow/126467606.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/storms-claim-another-life-in-uk/articleshow/126467606.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-11T21:45:28+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126467624,imgsize-253532.cms"/></item></channel></rss>